{"version":1,"content":"<p>早前出席「頑固台獨分子」、台北市長參選人沈伯洋競選造勢活動遭大陸輿論批評的台灣名嘴蔡康永，昨天深夜微博發文稱，「我一直希望兩岸友好來往。</p><p>我沒有支持過台獨。</p><p>」前《環球時報》總編輯胡錫進發文評論，指「蔡康永沒有就他的行為道歉」，要讓輿論轉向「差遠了」。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T07:20:48.246813+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":126,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T06:56:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T07:58:16.545819+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T07:18:06.208689+00:00","content_hash":"1cb22befec3ef4e5346ee12d34c6b4270681d28b8a9b5e7c8f0beabf8c8ee560","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}